XMVP.Portions:
[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "# The Margin\n**Title:** The Margin\n**Author:** Clods-Play Ensemble\n**Draft date:** 2026-01-27\n**Characters:** Martin, Vera, Claire, Hugh\n---",
    "dialogue": []
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "INT. CONSERVATORY - AFTERNOON\n*The room holds the golden dust of late summer light. MARTIN (55) stands near a dying rubber plant on a pedestal, watering can tilted. Water pools in the saucer beneath. He keeps pouring. VERA (52) sits in a wicker chair, a magazine open in her lap that she isn't reading. The pages haven't turned in some time.*",
    "dialogue": []
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThere.\n*Pause.*\nThat should do.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "There.",
        "start_offset": 0.0,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      },
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "That should do.",
        "start_offset": 0.4,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYes.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 1.6,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThey need consistency.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "They need consistency.",
        "start_offset": 2.0,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nOf course.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Of course.",
        "start_offset": 3.2,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nPeople underwater them. Or they forget entirely. Both extremes.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "People underwater them. Or they forget entirely. Both extremes.",
        "start_offset": 4.0,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYou've always been good with\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "You've always been good with\u2014",
        "start_offset": 7.6,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nIt's not about being good. It's about paying attention.\n*He sets down the can with precision, exactly where it was before. The plant's leaves are brown at the edges, curling.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "It's not about being good. It's about paying attention.",
        "start_offset": 9.6,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI thought we might have the chicken.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I thought we might have the chicken.",
        "start_offset": 13.2,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThe chicken.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "The chicken.",
        "start_offset": 16.0,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nFor dinner. The one I defrosted. Unless you'd rather\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "For dinner. The one I defrosted. Unless you'd rather\u2014",
        "start_offset": 16.8,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWhen did you defrost it?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "When did you defrost it?",
        "start_offset": 20.400000000000002,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThis morning. Or last night. I can't\u2014last night, I think.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "This morning. Or last night. I can't\u2014last night, I think.",
        "start_offset": 22.400000000000002,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYou think.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "You think.",
        "start_offset": 26.400000000000002,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nLast night.\n*Pause.*\nUnless that's too long?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Last night.",
        "start_offset": 27.200000000000003,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Unless that's too long?",
        "start_offset": 28.000000000000004,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nNo, that's\u2014that's within the window.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "No, that's\u2014that's within the window.",
        "start_offset": 29.600000000000005,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nGood. Good, I thought it was, but you know I sometimes\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Good. Good, I thought it was, but you know I sometimes\u2014",
        "start_offset": 31.600000000000005,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nIt's fine.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "It's fine.",
        "start_offset": 36.00000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nRight.\n*Silence.*\nWith the potatoes, maybe. The small ones.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Right.",
        "start_offset": 36.800000000000004,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "With the potatoes, maybe. The small ones.",
        "start_offset": 37.2,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThe fingerlings.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "The fingerlings.",
        "start_offset": 40.0,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYes. Those.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Yes. Those.",
        "start_offset": 40.8,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThey take longer.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "They take longer.",
        "start_offset": 41.599999999999994,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 3
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI know.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I know.",
        "start_offset": 42.8,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 5
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nSo you'd need to start them earlier than you think.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "So you'd need to start them earlier than you think.",
        "start_offset": 43.599999999999994,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 7
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI will.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I will.",
        "start_offset": 47.599999999999994,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 9
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nPeople always underestimate root vegetables.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "People always underestimate root vegetables.",
        "start_offset": 48.39999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 11
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI'll start them early.\n*The fan completes another rotation. MARTIN examines the plant more closely, touching a brown leaf. It comes away in his fingers. He looks at it for a moment, then slips it into his pocket.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I'll start them early.",
        "start_offset": 50.39999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 13
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nShe hasn't come down.\n*Pause.*\nSince this morning.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "She hasn't come down.",
        "start_offset": 51.99999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 16
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Since this morning.",
        "start_offset": 53.599999999999994,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 18
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWho?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Who?",
        "start_offset": 54.8,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 20
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nClaire.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Claire.",
        "start_offset": 55.199999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 22
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nAh.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Ah.",
        "start_offset": 55.599999999999994,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 24
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nSince breakfast. Or before breakfast. I brought her tea around nine, and she was\u2014well, she thanked me. She was very polite.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Since breakfast. Or before breakfast. I brought her tea around nine, and she was\u2014well, she thanked me. She was very polite.",
        "start_offset": 55.99999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 26
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThat's good.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "That's good.",
        "start_offset": 64.39999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 28
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nBut she hasn't\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "But she hasn't\u2014",
        "start_offset": 65.19999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 30
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nPerhaps she's resting.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Perhaps she's resting.",
        "start_offset": 66.39999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 32
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYes.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 67.6,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 34
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nIt's a long journey.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "It's a long journey.",
        "start_offset": 68.0,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 36
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nNot that long.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Not that long.",
        "start_offset": 69.6,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 38
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nLong enough.\n*Pause.*\nPeople need time to adjust.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Long enough.",
        "start_offset": 70.8,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 40
      },
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "People need time to adjust.",
        "start_offset": 71.6,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 42
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI just thought she might\u2014I don't know. Come down. See the garden. It's lovely in this light.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I just thought she might\u2014I don't know. Come down. See the garden. It's lovely in this light.",
        "start_offset": 73.6,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 44
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYou could suggest it.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "You could suggest it.",
        "start_offset": 80.39999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 46
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nOh, I wouldn't want to\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Oh, I wouldn't want to\u2014",
        "start_offset": 81.99999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 48
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWhy not?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Why not?",
        "start_offset": 83.99999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 50
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nIntrude.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Intrude.",
        "start_offset": 84.79999999999998,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 52
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nIt's your house.\n*VERA's laugh comes too quickly, too high.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "It's your house.",
        "start_offset": 85.19999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 54
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nOur house.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Our house.",
        "start_offset": 86.39999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 57
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYes.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 87.19999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 59
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nAnd hers now. While she's\u2014for however long she\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "And hers now. While she's\u2014for however long she\u2014",
        "start_offset": 87.6,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 61
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThe guest room.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "The guest room.",
        "start_offset": 90.8,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 63
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 92.0,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 65
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYou said 'her room.' It's the guest room.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "You said 'her room.' It's the guest room.",
        "start_offset": 92.4,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 67
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI meant\u2014yes. Of course. The guest room.\n*Long pause.*\nHow long do you think\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I meant\u2014yes. Of course. The guest room.",
        "start_offset": 95.60000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 69
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "How long do you think\u2014",
        "start_offset": 98.4,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 71
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nDid she say?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Did she say?",
        "start_offset": 100.4,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 73
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nNot exactly.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Not exactly.",
        "start_offset": 101.60000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 75
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThen we can't know.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Then we can't know.",
        "start_offset": 102.4,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 77
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nNo.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 104.0,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 79
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nIt would be presumptuous to ask.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "It would be presumptuous to ask.",
        "start_offset": 104.4,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 81
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI suppose.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I suppose.",
        "start_offset": 106.80000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 83
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWhen my sister visited\u2014you remember\u2014I gave her a week. Precisely. I told her at the outset: \"Seven days, Margaret. That's the shape of hospitality.\"\n*Pause.*\nShe understood perfectly. Left on the sixth day, actually. Said she'd seen enough.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "When my sister visited\u2014you remember\u2014I gave her a week. Precisely. I told her at the outset: \"Seven days, Margaret. That's the shape of hospitality.\"",
        "start_offset": 107.60000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 85
      },
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "She understood perfectly. Left on the sixth day, actually. Said she'd seen enough.",
        "start_offset": 117.20000000000002,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 87
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThis is different.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "This is different.",
        "start_offset": 122.40000000000002,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 89
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nIs it?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Is it?",
        "start_offset": 123.60000000000002,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 91
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nClaire isn't your sister.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Claire isn't your sister.",
        "start_offset": 124.40000000000002,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 93
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nNo. She's yours.\n*He looks at the plant again.*\nWhich makes the question of duration even more delicate.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "No. She's yours.",
        "start_offset": 126.00000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 95
      },
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Which makes the question of duration even more delicate.",
        "start_offset": 127.20000000000002,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 97
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYou're right.\n*Pause.*\nI shouldn't wonder about things.\n*She touches her temple.*\nI used to be better at not\u2014\n*Stops herself, laughs wrongly.*\nSorry. Ignore me.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "You're right.",
        "start_offset": 130.8,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 99
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I shouldn't wonder about things.",
        "start_offset": 131.60000000000002,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 101
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I used to be better at not\u2014",
        "start_offset": 133.60000000000002,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 103
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Sorry. Ignore me.",
        "start_offset": 136.40000000000003,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 105
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThese rings.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "These rings.",
        "start_offset": 137.60000000000002,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 107
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhat? Oh. Yes. Those are from\u2014I put the vase there yesterday. The condensation. I meant to wipe them. I'm sorry.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "What? Oh. Yes. Those are from\u2014I put the vase there yesterday. The condensation. I meant to wipe them. I'm sorry.",
        "start_offset": 138.40000000000003,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 109
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWater rings.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Water rings.",
        "start_offset": 146.40000000000003,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 111
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI know. I should have been more careful.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I know. I should have been more careful.",
        "start_offset": 147.20000000000005,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 113
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThey're permanent now.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "They're permanent now.",
        "start_offset": 150.40000000000003,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 115
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYes.\n*Pause.*\nI could get placemats. Nice ones. To cover\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 151.60000000000002,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 117
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I could get placemats. Nice ones. To cover\u2014",
        "start_offset": 152.00000000000003,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 119
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThat's not the point.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "That's not the point.",
        "start_offset": 155.20000000000002,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 121
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nNo. Of course not.\n*She closes the magazine. Opens it again to a different page.*\nDid you want lemon with it?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "No. Of course not.",
        "start_offset": 156.8,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 123
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Did you want lemon with it?",
        "start_offset": 158.4,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 125
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWith what?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "With what?",
        "start_offset": 160.8,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 127
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThe chicken.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "The chicken.",
        "start_offset": 161.60000000000002,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 129
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nI hadn't thought about lemon.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "I hadn't thought about lemon.",
        "start_offset": 162.40000000000003,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 131
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYou usually like lemon.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "You usually like lemon.",
        "start_offset": 164.40000000000003,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 133
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nDo I?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Do I?",
        "start_offset": 166.00000000000003,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 135
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWith chicken. And fish, obviously. And sometimes the pork, though not always.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "With chicken. And fish, obviously. And sometimes the pork, though not always.",
        "start_offset": 166.80000000000004,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 137
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nI don't think I'm particular about lemon.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "I don't think I'm particular about lemon.",
        "start_offset": 171.60000000000005,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 139
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nMaybe I'm thinking of someone else.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Maybe I'm thinking of someone else.",
        "start_offset": 174.40000000000006,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 141
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 82,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWho else would you be thinking of?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Who else would you be thinking of?",
        "start_offset": 176.80000000000007,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 143
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 83,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nNo one. I meant\u2014just in general. People like lemon.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "No one. I meant\u2014just in general. People like lemon.",
        "start_offset": 179.60000000000008,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 145
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 84,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nSome people.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Some people.",
        "start_offset": 183.20000000000007,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 147
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 85,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYes.\n*Silence.*\nI'll get some anyway. Just in case.\n*MARTIN returns to the plant, tilts his head at it.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 184.00000000000009,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 149
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I'll get some anyway. Just in case.",
        "start_offset": 184.4000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 151
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 86,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nDid you move my papers?\n*VERA goes very still.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Did you move my papers?",
        "start_offset": 187.2000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 154
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 87,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhich papers?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Which papers?",
        "start_offset": 189.2000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 157
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 88,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nFrom the desk.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "From the desk.",
        "start_offset": 190.0000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 159
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 89,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThe one in the hall?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "The one in the hall?",
        "start_offset": 191.2000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 161
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 90,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYes.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 193.2000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 163
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 91,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI needed the space.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I needed the space.",
        "start_offset": 193.6000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 165
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 92,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nFor what?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "For what?",
        "start_offset": 195.2000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 167
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 93,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nHer things. Claire's things. She had a bag, and I thought\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Her things. Claire's things. She had a bag, and I thought\u2014",
        "start_offset": 196.0000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 169
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 94,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThere are other surfaces.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "There are other surfaces.",
        "start_offset": 200.40000000000012,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 171
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 95,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI know. I should have asked. I'm sorry.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I know. I should have asked. I'm sorry.",
        "start_offset": 202.0000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 173
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 96,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nI had them arranged.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "I had them arranged.",
        "start_offset": 205.2000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 175
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 97,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI was careful. I stacked them\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I was careful. I stacked them\u2014",
        "start_offset": 206.8000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 177
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 98,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nI had them arranged.\n*Pause.*\nIn a particular order.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "I had them arranged.",
        "start_offset": 209.2000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 179
      },
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "In a particular order.",
        "start_offset": 210.8000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 181
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 99,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI didn't realize.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I didn't realize.",
        "start_offset": 212.4000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 183
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 100,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nNo.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 213.60000000000008,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 185
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 101,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhere should I\u2014would you like me to put them back?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Where should I\u2014would you like me to put them back?",
        "start_offset": 214.00000000000009,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 187
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 102,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nIt doesn't matter now.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "It doesn't matter now.",
        "start_offset": 218.00000000000009,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 189
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 103,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nMartin\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Martin\u2014",
        "start_offset": 219.60000000000008,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 191
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 104,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThe order is lost.\n*He says this as if describing a death.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "The order is lost.",
        "start_offset": 220.00000000000009,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 193
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 105,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI could try to remember\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I could try to remember\u2014",
        "start_offset": 221.60000000000008,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 196
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 106,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nDon't.\n*VERA folds her hands in her lap, then unfolds them, then folds them again.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Don't.",
        "start_offset": 223.60000000000008,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 198
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 107,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI was only trying to make space.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I was only trying to make space.",
        "start_offset": 224.00000000000009,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 201
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 108,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nI didn't ask you to make space.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "I didn't ask you to make space.",
        "start_offset": 226.8000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 203
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 109,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nNo.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 229.6000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 205
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 110,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nSo why did you?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "So why did you?",
        "start_offset": 230.0000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 207
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 111,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI thought\u2014\n*Pause.*\nShe's our guest.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I thought\u2014",
        "start_offset": 231.6000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 209
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "She's our guest.",
        "start_offset": 232.40000000000012,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 211
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 112,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYou keep saying that.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "You keep saying that.",
        "start_offset": 233.6000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 213
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 113,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 235.2000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 215
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 114,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nOur guest. She's family.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Our guest. She's family.",
        "start_offset": 235.6000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 217
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 115,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYes.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 237.2000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 219
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 116,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nSo you don't need to\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "So you don't need to\u2014",
        "start_offset": 237.6000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 221
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 117,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 239.6000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 223
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 118,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nPerform.\n*VERA's face does something complicated.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Perform.",
        "start_offset": 240.0000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 225
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 119,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI'm not performing.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I'm not performing.",
        "start_offset": 240.40000000000012,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 228
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 120,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nGood.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Good.",
        "start_offset": 241.6000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 230
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 121,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI'm just trying to\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I'm just trying to\u2014",
        "start_offset": 242.0000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 232
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 122,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 243.6000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 234
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 123,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nMake her comfortable.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Make her comfortable.",
        "start_offset": 244.0000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 236
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 124,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nBy rearranging everything?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "By rearranging everything?",
        "start_offset": 245.2000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 238
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 125,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nNot everything. Just the\u2014it was only the desk, Martin.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Not everything. Just the\u2014it was only the desk, Martin.",
        "start_offset": 246.4000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 240
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 126,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nAnd the room.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "And the room.",
        "start_offset": 250.00000000000009,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 242
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 127,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhat about the room?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "What about the room?",
        "start_offset": 251.20000000000007,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 244
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 128,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYou changed the sheets.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "You changed the sheets.",
        "start_offset": 252.80000000000007,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 246
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 129,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nOf course I changed the sheets.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Of course I changed the sheets.",
        "start_offset": 254.40000000000006,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 248
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 130,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThey were clean.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "They were clean.",
        "start_offset": 256.80000000000007,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 250
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 131,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThey'd been on for\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "They'd been on for\u2014",
        "start_offset": 258.00000000000006,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 252
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 132,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nA week. Two at most.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "A week. Two at most.",
        "start_offset": 259.6000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 254
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 133,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThree.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Three.",
        "start_offset": 261.6000000000001,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 256
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 134,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThat's acceptable.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "That's acceptable.",
        "start_offset": 262.00000000000006,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 258
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 135,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nFor a guest?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "For a guest?",
        "start_offset": 262.80000000000007,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 260
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 136,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nShe's not a\u2014\n*He stops.*\n*Long pause. The fan rotates. Once. Twice. The sound of something growing in the garden outside\u2014or dying. Hard to tell which.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "She's not a\u2014",
        "start_offset": 264.00000000000006,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 262
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 137,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWould you like a drink?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Would you like a drink?",
        "start_offset": 265.20000000000005,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 266
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 138,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nIt's three o'clock.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "It's three o'clock.",
        "start_offset": 267.20000000000005,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 268
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 139,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nIs it?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Is it?",
        "start_offset": 268.40000000000003,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 270
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 140,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nNearly.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Nearly.",
        "start_offset": 269.20000000000005,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 272
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 141,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI lose track in here. The light's always\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I lose track in here. The light's always\u2014",
        "start_offset": 269.6,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 274
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 142,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 272.8,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 276
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 143,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThe same. Sort of. Golden.\n*Pause.*\nPreserved.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "The same. Sort of. Golden.",
        "start_offset": 273.2,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 278
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Preserved.",
        "start_offset": 275.2,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 280
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 144,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThat doesn't make sense.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "That doesn't make sense.",
        "start_offset": 275.59999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 282
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 145,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nNo.\n*She touches the magazine, not opening it.*\nI could make coffee.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 277.2,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 284
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I could make coffee.",
        "start_offset": 277.59999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 286
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 146,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYou've already had two cups.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "You've already had two cups.",
        "start_offset": 279.2,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 288
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 147,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nHave I?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Have I?",
        "start_offset": 281.2,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 290
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 148,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThis morning. I heard the machine.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "This morning. I heard the machine.",
        "start_offset": 282.0,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 292
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 149,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYou're right. Yes. Two cups.\n*Pause.*\nMaybe tea then.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "You're right. Yes. Two cups.",
        "start_offset": 284.4,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 294
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Maybe tea then.",
        "start_offset": 286.4,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 296
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 150,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nI don't want tea.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "I don't want tea.",
        "start_offset": 287.59999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 298
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 151,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nNo. Of course.\n*Long pause.*\nShe might want tea.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "No. Of course.",
        "start_offset": 289.2,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 300
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "She might want tea.",
        "start_offset": 290.4,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 302
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 152,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThen ask her.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Then ask her.",
        "start_offset": 292.0,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 304
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 153,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI brought her some. Earlier.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I brought her some. Earlier.",
        "start_offset": 293.2,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 306
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 154,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nSo she's had tea.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "So she's had tea.",
        "start_offset": 295.2,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 308
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 155,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThe cup was still full when I\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "The cup was still full when I\u2014",
        "start_offset": 296.8,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 310
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 156,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWhen you what?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "When you what?",
        "start_offset": 299.6,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 312
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 157,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nNothing. I shouldn't have\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Nothing. I shouldn't have\u2014",
        "start_offset": 300.8,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 314
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 158,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nChecked?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Checked?",
        "start_offset": 302.40000000000003,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 316
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 159,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI wasn't checking. I was passing by, and the door was\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I wasn't checking. I was passing by, and the door was\u2014",
        "start_offset": 302.8,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 318
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 160,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nOpen?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Open?",
        "start_offset": 307.2,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 320
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 161,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nSlightly. Just slightly.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Slightly. Just slightly.",
        "start_offset": 307.59999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 322
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 162,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nAnd?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "And?",
        "start_offset": 308.79999999999995,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 324
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 163,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThe tea was there. On the bedside table. Cold probably.\n*Pause.*\nShe was facing the wall.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "The tea was there. On the bedside table. Cold probably.",
        "start_offset": 309.19999999999993,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 326
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "She was facing the wall.",
        "start_offset": 313.19999999999993,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 328
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 164,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nSleeping?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Sleeping?",
        "start_offset": 315.19999999999993,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 330
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 165,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI don't know.\n*MARTIN touches the plant again, differently this time. A diagnosis.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I don't know.",
        "start_offset": 315.5999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 332
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 166,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nDid she seem\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Did she seem\u2014",
        "start_offset": 316.7999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 335
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 167,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 317.9999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 337
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 168,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nDistressed.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Distressed.",
        "start_offset": 318.39999999999986,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 339
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 169,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI couldn't see her face.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I couldn't see her face.",
        "start_offset": 318.79999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 341
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 170,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nBut her posture.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "But her posture.",
        "start_offset": 320.79999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 343
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 171,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nStill. Very still.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Still. Very still.",
        "start_offset": 321.99999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 345
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 172,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nPeople are still when they're resting.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "People are still when they're resting.",
        "start_offset": 323.1999999999998,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 347
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 173,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYes.\n*Silence.*\nBut there's still, and then there's\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 325.5999999999998,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 349
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "But there's still, and then there's\u2014",
        "start_offset": 325.9999999999998,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 351
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 174,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 328.39999999999975,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 353
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 175,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nAbsent.\n*MARTIN turns to look at her properly for the first time.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Absent.",
        "start_offset": 328.7999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 355
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 176,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nAbsent.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Absent.",
        "start_offset": 329.1999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 358
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 177,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThat's not\u2014I don't mean she wasn't there. Obviously she was there. I saw her.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "That's not\u2014I don't mean she wasn't there. Obviously she was there. I saw her.",
        "start_offset": 329.5999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 360
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 178,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThen what do you mean?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Then what do you mean?",
        "start_offset": 335.1999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 362
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 179,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nElsewhere.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Elsewhere.",
        "start_offset": 337.1999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 364
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 180,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThat's the same thing.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "That's the same thing.",
        "start_offset": 337.5999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 366
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 181,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nNo.\n*Pause.*\nIt's different.\n*MARTIN returns his attention to the plant. He touches a leaf, examines the soil, runs his finger along the pot's rim.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 339.1999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 368
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "It's different.",
        "start_offset": 339.5999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 370
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 182,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThis needs repotting.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "This needs repotting.",
        "start_offset": 340.3999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 373
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 183,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nDoes it?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Does it?",
        "start_offset": 341.5999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 375
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 184,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThe roots are probably bound. Circling. Strangling themselves, essentially.\n*Pause.*\nI've been watering it consistently. Every day. Same time. Same amount. That's what they require\u2014predictability. Order.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "The roots are probably bound. Circling. Strangling themselves, essentially.",
        "start_offset": 342.3999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 377
      },
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "I've been watering it consistently. Every day. Same time. Same amount. That's what they require\u2014predictability. Order.",
        "start_offset": 345.9999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 379
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 185,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nMartin\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Martin\u2014",
        "start_offset": 352.3999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 381
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 186,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nMost people give up too soon. They see a few brown leaves and they assume failure. But if you maintain the routine, if you don't deviate\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Most people give up too soon. They see a few brown leaves and they assume failure. But if you maintain the routine, if you don't deviate\u2014",
        "start_offset": 352.79999999999967,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 383
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 187,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThe plant is dead.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "The plant is dead.",
        "start_offset": 363.19999999999965,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 385
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 188,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThere's still green at the base.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "There's still green at the base.",
        "start_offset": 364.79999999999967,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 387
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 189,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThat's the pot. The glaze.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "That's the pot. The glaze.",
        "start_offset": 367.19999999999965,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 389
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 190,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nNo. Look here. This stem.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "No. Look here. This stem.",
        "start_offset": 369.19999999999965,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 391
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 191,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nBrown.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Brown.",
        "start_offset": 371.19999999999965,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 393
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 192,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWith green underneath. You have to know where to look.\n*He continues examining it, absorbed.*\nThree weeks I've been giving it exactly what it needs. Morning light. Consistent moisture. I even researched the optimal temperature range\u2014did you know they prefer sixty-five to seventy-five degrees? I've been monitoring.\n*Pause.*\nThat's commitment. That's care.\n*He looks up, realizes VERA hasn't spoken. She's watching him with something that might be pity.*\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "With green underneath. You have to know where to look.",
        "start_offset": 371.5999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 395
      },
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Three weeks I've been giving it exactly what it needs. Morning light. Consistent moisture. I even researched the optimal temperature range\u2014did you know they prefer sixty-five to seventy-five degrees? I've been monitoring.",
        "start_offset": 375.5999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 397
      },
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "That's commitment. That's care.",
        "start_offset": 388.39999999999964,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 399
      },
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 389.99999999999966,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 401
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 193,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nNothing.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Nothing.",
        "start_offset": 390.39999999999964,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 403
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 194,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYou're looking at me.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "You're looking at me.",
        "start_offset": 390.7999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 405
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 195,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI'm listening.\n*Silence. MARTIN returns to the plant, more carefully now.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I'm listening.",
        "start_offset": 392.39999999999964,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 407
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 196,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nPeople think gardening is about instinct. It's not. It's about method. Discipline. If you follow the proper steps\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "People think gardening is about instinct. It's not. It's about method. Discipline. If you follow the proper steps\u2014",
        "start_offset": 393.19999999999965,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 410
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 197,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nIt's dead, Martin.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "It's dead, Martin.",
        "start_offset": 400.39999999999964,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 412
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 198,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYou're not qualified to make that determination.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "You're not qualified to make that determination.",
        "start_offset": 401.5999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 414
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 199,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI can see it.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I can see it.",
        "start_offset": 404.39999999999964,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 416
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 200,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nSeeing isn't knowing.\n*Pause.*\nI've done everything correctly.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Seeing isn't knowing.",
        "start_offset": 405.99999999999966,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 418
      },
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "I've done everything correctly.",
        "start_offset": 407.19999999999965,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 420
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 201,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI know.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I know.",
        "start_offset": 408.79999999999967,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 422
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 202,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThen how can it be\u2014\n*He stops.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Then how can it be\u2014",
        "start_offset": 409.5999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 424
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 203,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nSometimes things die anyway.\n*MARTIN picks up the watering can again.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Sometimes things die anyway.",
        "start_offset": 411.5999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 427
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 204,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nIt needs consistency.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "It needs consistency.",
        "start_offset": 413.1999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 430
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 205,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nIt needs to be thrown away.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "It needs to be thrown away.",
        "start_offset": 414.3999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 432
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 206,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThat's wasteful.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "That's wasteful.",
        "start_offset": 416.79999999999967,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 434
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 207,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nKeeping it is wasteful.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Keeping it is wasteful.",
        "start_offset": 417.5999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 436
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 208,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWhy?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Why?",
        "start_offset": 419.1999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 438
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 209,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYour time. The water. The\u2014\n*Pause.*\nThe pretending.\n*MARTIN sets down the can. Doesn't look at her.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Your time. The water. The\u2014",
        "start_offset": 419.5999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 440
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "The pretending.",
        "start_offset": 421.5999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 442
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 210,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nI'm not pretending.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "I'm not pretending.",
        "start_offset": 422.3999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 445
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 211,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nNo.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 423.5999999999997,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 447
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 212,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nI'm being thorough.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "I'm being thorough.",
        "start_offset": 423.99999999999966,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 449
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 213,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYes.\n*Long pause.*\nWhat if she doesn't come down?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 425.19999999999965,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 451
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "What if she doesn't come down?",
        "start_offset": 425.5999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 453
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 214,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nShe will.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "She will.",
        "start_offset": 427.9999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 455
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 215,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nBut what if she doesn't?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "But what if she doesn't?",
        "start_offset": 428.7999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 457
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 216,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThen she doesn't.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Then she doesn't.",
        "start_offset": 430.7999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 459
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 217,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nFor dinner, I mean.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "For dinner, I mean.",
        "start_offset": 431.9999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 461
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 218,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nMake enough for three. If she doesn't appear, there'll be leftovers.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Make enough for three. If she doesn't appear, there'll be leftovers.",
        "start_offset": 433.5999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 463
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 219,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThat seems\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "That seems\u2014",
        "start_offset": 437.9999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 465
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 220,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 438.7999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 467
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 221,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nSad.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Sad.",
        "start_offset": 439.1999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 469
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 222,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWhy?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Why?",
        "start_offset": 439.59999999999957,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 471
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 223,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nSetting a place and then\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Setting a place and then\u2014",
        "start_offset": 439.99999999999955,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 473
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 224,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThen what?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Then what?",
        "start_offset": 441.99999999999955,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 475
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 225,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nClearing it away. Uneaten.\n*MARTIN adjusts his watch, though it's already precise.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Clearing it away. Uneaten.",
        "start_offset": 442.79999999999956,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 477
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 226,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYou're catastrophizing.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "You're catastrophizing.",
        "start_offset": 444.3999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 480
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 227,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI'm imagining.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I'm imagining.",
        "start_offset": 445.1999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 482
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 228,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nIt's the same thing.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "It's the same thing.",
        "start_offset": 445.9999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 484
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 229,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nNo.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 447.5999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 486
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 230,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYes. You imagine disasters, and then you live inside them.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Yes. You imagine disasters, and then you live inside them.",
        "start_offset": 447.9999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 488
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 231,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI'm only thinking\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I'm only thinking\u2014",
        "start_offset": 451.9999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 490
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 232,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nToo much.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Too much.",
        "start_offset": 453.1999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 492
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 233,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThat she might need\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "That she might need\u2014",
        "start_offset": 453.9999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 494
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 234,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 455.5999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 496
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 235,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nSomething.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Something.",
        "start_offset": 455.9999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 498
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 236,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nSuch as?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Such as?",
        "start_offset": 456.3999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 500
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 237,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI don't know. That's the\u2014I don't know what she needs.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I don't know. That's the\u2014I don't know what she needs.",
        "start_offset": 457.1999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 502
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 238,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nNeither does she, probably.\n*VERA looks at him. He doesn't return the look.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Neither does she, probably.",
        "start_offset": 461.1999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 504
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 239,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nShould we ask her?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Should we ask her?",
        "start_offset": 462.7999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 507
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 240,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nAsk her what she needs?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Ask her what she needs?",
        "start_offset": 464.39999999999964,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 509
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 241,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYes.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 466.39999999999964,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 511
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 242,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nNo.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 466.7999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 513
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 243,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhy not?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Why not?",
        "start_offset": 467.1999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 515
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 244,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nBecause then she'd have to know. And she doesn't.\n*Pause.*\nNobody knows what they need when they first arrive.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Because then she'd have to know. And she doesn't.",
        "start_offset": 467.9999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 517
      },
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Nobody knows what they need when they first arrive.",
        "start_offset": 471.5999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 519
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 245,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nArrive from where?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Arrive from where?",
        "start_offset": 475.19999999999965,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 521
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 246,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWherever she was.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Wherever she was.",
        "start_offset": 476.39999999999964,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 523
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 247,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nBut where was\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "But where was\u2014",
        "start_offset": 477.5999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 525
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 248,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nDoes it matter?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Does it matter?",
        "start_offset": 478.7999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 527
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 249,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI thought it might. For context.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I thought it might. For context.",
        "start_offset": 479.9999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 529
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 250,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nShe's here now. That's the relevant information.\n*VERA smooths the magazine page. It refuses to stay smooth.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "She's here now. That's the relevant information.",
        "start_offset": 482.3999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 531
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 251,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nHow long do you think before\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "How long do you think before\u2014",
        "start_offset": 485.1999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 534
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 252,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nBefore what?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Before what?",
        "start_offset": 487.59999999999957,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 536
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 253,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nBefore she's ready to\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Before she's ready to\u2014",
        "start_offset": 488.3999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 538
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 254,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nTo what?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "To what?",
        "start_offset": 489.9999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 540
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 255,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nTalk about it.\n*MARTIN finally looks at VERA directly. His face is careful.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Talk about it.",
        "start_offset": 490.7999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 542
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 256,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nAbout what?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "About what?",
        "start_offset": 491.9999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 545
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 257,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhatever\u2014\n*Pause.*\nWhatever it is.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Whatever\u2014",
        "start_offset": 492.7999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 547
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Whatever it is.",
        "start_offset": 493.1999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 549
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 258,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThere might not be an 'it.'",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "There might not be an 'it.'",
        "start_offset": 494.3999999999996,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 551
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 259,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nMartin.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Martin.",
        "start_offset": 496.79999999999956,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 553
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 260,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 497.19999999999953,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 555
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 261,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nPeople don't just\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "People don't just\u2014",
        "start_offset": 497.5999999999995,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 557
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 262,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 498.7999999999995,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 559
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 263,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nAppear.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Appear.",
        "start_offset": 499.1999999999995,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 561
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 264,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nShe didn't appear. She arrived.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "She didn't appear. She arrived.",
        "start_offset": 499.59999999999945,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 563
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 265,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nAt four in the morning.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "At four in the morning.",
        "start_offset": 501.59999999999945,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 565
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 266,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThe train schedule isn't her fault.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "The train schedule isn't her fault.",
        "start_offset": 503.59999999999945,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 567
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 267,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWith one bag.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "With one bag.",
        "start_offset": 505.99999999999943,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 569
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 268,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nSome people travel light.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Some people travel light.",
        "start_offset": 507.1999999999994,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 571
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 269,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nAnd no warning.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "And no warning.",
        "start_offset": 508.79999999999944,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 573
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 270,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nShe called.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "She called.",
        "start_offset": 509.99999999999943,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 575
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 271,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nTwo hours before.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Two hours before.",
        "start_offset": 510.79999999999944,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 577
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 272,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThat's warning.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "That's warning.",
        "start_offset": 511.99999999999943,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 579
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 273,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThat's announcement.\n*Pause.*\nThere's a difference.\n*MARTIN moves toward the glass wall, looks out at the overgrown garden.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "That's announcement.",
        "start_offset": 512.7999999999994,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 581
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "There's a difference.",
        "start_offset": 513.5999999999993,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 583
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 274,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThe roses need cutting back.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "The roses need cutting back.",
        "start_offset": 514.7999999999994,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 586
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 275,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI know.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I know.",
        "start_offset": 516.7999999999994,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 588
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 276,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThey're going to seed.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "They're going to seed.",
        "start_offset": 517.5999999999993,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 590
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 277,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYes.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 519.1999999999994,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 592
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 278,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThey'll strangle everything if we're not careful.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "They'll strangle everything if we're not careful.",
        "start_offset": 519.5999999999993,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 594
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 279,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI'll do it tomorrow.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I'll do it tomorrow.",
        "start_offset": 522.3999999999993,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 596
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 280,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThey should have been done last month.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "They should have been done last month.",
        "start_offset": 523.9999999999993,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 598
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 281,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI forgot.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I forgot.",
        "start_offset": 526.7999999999993,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 600
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 282,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nHow do you forget?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "How do you forget?",
        "start_offset": 527.5999999999992,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 602
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 283,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI've been\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I've been\u2014",
        "start_offset": 529.1999999999992,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 604
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 284,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 529.9999999999992,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 606
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 285,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nDistracted.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Distracted.",
        "start_offset": 530.3999999999992,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 608
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 286,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nBy what?\n*VERA doesn't answer. The fan rotates.*\nI could do it.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "By what?",
        "start_offset": 530.7999999999992,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 610
      },
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "I could do it.",
        "start_offset": 531.5999999999991,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 612
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 287,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThe roses?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "The roses?",
        "start_offset": 533.1999999999991,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 614
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 288,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYes.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 533.9999999999991,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 616
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 289,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYou don't like gardening.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "You don't like gardening.",
        "start_offset": 534.3999999999991,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 618
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 290,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nI don't mind cutting things back.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "I don't mind cutting things back.",
        "start_offset": 535.9999999999991,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 620
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 291,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThat's different from gardening.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "That's different from gardening.",
        "start_offset": 538.3999999999991,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 622
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 292,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nIs it?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Is it?",
        "start_offset": 539.9999999999991,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 624
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 293,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nGardening is helping things grow. What you're describing is\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Gardening is helping things grow. What you're describing is\u2014",
        "start_offset": 540.799999999999,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 626
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 294,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 544.3999999999991,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 628
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 295,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nPruning.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Pruning.",
        "start_offset": 544.799999999999,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 630
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 296,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nSame thing.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Same thing.",
        "start_offset": 545.199999999999,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 632
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 297,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nNo.\n*Pause.*\nOne is encouragement. The other is control.\n*MARTIN turns from the window.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 545.999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 634
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "One is encouragement. The other is control.",
        "start_offset": 546.399999999999,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 636
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 298,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYou think I'm controlling.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "You think I'm controlling.",
        "start_offset": 549.1999999999989,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 639
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 299,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI didn't say\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I didn't say\u2014",
        "start_offset": 550.7999999999989,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 641
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 300,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYou implied it.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "You implied it.",
        "start_offset": 551.999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 643
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 301,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI was talking about roses.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I was talking about roses.",
        "start_offset": 553.199999999999,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 645
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 302,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWere you?\n*Silence. Long. The quality of the light shifts almost imperceptibly.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Were you?",
        "start_offset": 555.199999999999,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 647
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 303,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI should start the potatoes.\n*She doesn't move.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I should start the potatoes.",
        "start_offset": 555.999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 650
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 304,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYes.\n*Neither of them moves.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 557.999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 653
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 305,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThe fingerlings.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "The fingerlings.",
        "start_offset": 558.399999999999,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 656
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 306,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nRight.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Right.",
        "start_offset": 559.1999999999989,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 658
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 307,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThey take longer.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "They take longer.",
        "start_offset": 559.5999999999989,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 660
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 308,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYou mentioned that.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "You mentioned that.",
        "start_offset": 560.7999999999989,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 662
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 309,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nDid I?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Did I?",
        "start_offset": 561.999999999999,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 664
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 310,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nJust now. About the potatoes.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Just now. About the potatoes.",
        "start_offset": 562.7999999999989,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 666
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 311,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI meant you mentioned it. Earlier.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I meant you mentioned it. Earlier.",
        "start_offset": 564.7999999999989,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 668
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 312,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nDid I?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Did I?",
        "start_offset": 567.1999999999989,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 670
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 313,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nAbout them taking longer. About people underestimating\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "About them taking longer. About people underestimating\u2014",
        "start_offset": 567.9999999999989,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 672
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 314,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nRoot vegetables.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Root vegetables.",
        "start_offset": 570.7999999999988,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 674
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 315,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYes.\n*She stands. Sits again.*\nMaybe I'll wait.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 571.5999999999988,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 676
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Maybe I'll wait.",
        "start_offset": 571.9999999999987,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 678
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 316,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nFor what?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "For what?",
        "start_offset": 573.1999999999988,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 680
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 317,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nTo see if she\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "To see if she\u2014",
        "start_offset": 573.9999999999987,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 682
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 318,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nShe won't come down yet.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "She won't come down yet.",
        "start_offset": 575.5999999999988,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 684
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 319,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nHow do you know?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "How do you know?",
        "start_offset": 577.5999999999988,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 686
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 320,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nI don't. But you're acting as if\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "I don't. But you're acting as if\u2014",
        "start_offset": 579.1999999999988,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 688
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 321,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 581.9999999999987,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 690
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 322,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nAs if her coming down depends on you waiting.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "As if her coming down depends on you waiting.",
        "start_offset": 582.3999999999987,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 692
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 323,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThat's not\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "That's not\u2014",
        "start_offset": 585.9999999999987,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 694
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 324,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nIt is.\n*Pause.*\nYou do this.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "It is.",
        "start_offset": 586.7999999999987,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 696
      },
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "You do this.",
        "start_offset": 587.5999999999987,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 698
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 325,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nDo what?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Do what?",
        "start_offset": 588.7999999999987,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 700
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 326,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nHold yourself hostage to other people's timing.\n*VERA stands again. This time she stays standing.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Hold yourself hostage to other people's timing.",
        "start_offset": 589.5999999999987,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 702
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 327,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI'm going to check on her.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I'm going to check on her.",
        "start_offset": 592.3999999999986,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 705
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 328,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nNo.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 594.7999999999986,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 707
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 329,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhy not?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Why not?",
        "start_offset": 595.1999999999986,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 709
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 330,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nBecause she's\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Because she's\u2014",
        "start_offset": 595.9999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 711
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 331,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 596.7999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 713
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 332,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nAdjusting.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Adjusting.",
        "start_offset": 597.1999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 715
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 333,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nTo what?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "To what?",
        "start_offset": 597.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 717
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 334,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nBeing here.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Being here.",
        "start_offset": 598.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 719
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 335,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nShe's been here for\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "She's been here for\u2014",
        "start_offset": 599.1999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 721
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 336,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nSeven hours.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Seven hours.",
        "start_offset": 600.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 723
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 337,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYou've been counting.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "You've been counting.",
        "start_offset": 601.5999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 725
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 338,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nI looked at the clock when she arrived. I looked at it just now. That's mathematics, not counting.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "I looked at the clock when she arrived. I looked at it just now. That's mathematics, not counting.",
        "start_offset": 602.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 727
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 339,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThere's a difference?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "There's a difference?",
        "start_offset": 609.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 729
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 340,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYes.\n*Pause.*\nCounting implies vigilance. Mathematics is observation.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 611.1999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 731
      },
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Counting implies vigilance. Mathematics is observation.",
        "start_offset": 611.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 733
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 341,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nAnd you're just observing.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "And you're just observing.",
        "start_offset": 613.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 735
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 342,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYes.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 615.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 737
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 343,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nNot vigilant.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Not vigilant.",
        "start_offset": 615.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 739
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 344,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nNo.\n*VERA moves toward the door to the house. Stops.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 616.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 741
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 345,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhat if something's wrong?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "What if something's wrong?",
        "start_offset": 617.1999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 744
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 346,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nSuch as?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Such as?",
        "start_offset": 618.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 746
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 347,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI don't know. That's why I want to check.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I don't know. That's why I want to check.",
        "start_offset": 619.5999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 748
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 348,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYou checked earlier.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "You checked earlier.",
        "start_offset": 623.1999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 750
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 349,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThat was hours ago.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "That was hours ago.",
        "start_offset": 624.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 752
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 350,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThree hours.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Three hours.",
        "start_offset": 625.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 754
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 351,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nStill.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Still.",
        "start_offset": 626.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 756
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 352,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThree hours is nothing.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Three hours is nothing.",
        "start_offset": 627.1999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 758
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 353,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nIt is if\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "It is if\u2014",
        "start_offset": 628.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 760
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 354,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nIf what?\n*VERA's hand is on the door handle.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "If what?",
        "start_offset": 629.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 762
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 355,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nIf she's\u2014\n*She can't finish.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "If she's\u2014",
        "start_offset": 630.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 765
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 356,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nShe's fine.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "She's fine.",
        "start_offset": 631.5999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 768
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 357,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nHow do you know?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "How do you know?",
        "start_offset": 632.3999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 770
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 358,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nBecause if she weren't, we'd know.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Because if she weren't, we'd know.",
        "start_offset": 633.9999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 772
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 359,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThat doesn't make sense.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "That doesn't make sense.",
        "start_offset": 636.3999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 774
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 360,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYes it does.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Yes it does.",
        "start_offset": 637.9999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 776
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 361,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nHow?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "How?",
        "start_offset": 639.1999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 778
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 362,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWe'd hear something. Or we wouldn't. Either way, we'd know.\n*VERA removes her hand from the door.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "We'd hear something. Or we wouldn't. Either way, we'd know.",
        "start_offset": 639.5999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 780
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 363,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThat's a terrible logic.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "That's a terrible logic.",
        "start_offset": 643.5999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 783
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 364,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nBut it's logic.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "But it's logic.",
        "start_offset": 645.1999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 785
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 365,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nIt's absence pretending to be logic.\n*MARTIN goes very still.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "It's absence pretending to be logic.",
        "start_offset": 646.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 787
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 366,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nI'm going to check something.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "I'm going to check something.",
        "start_offset": 648.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 790
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 367,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 650.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 792
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 368,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nIn the house.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "In the house.",
        "start_offset": 651.1999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 794
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 369,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhat thing?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "What thing?",
        "start_offset": 652.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 796
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 370,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nJust\u2014something.\n*He moves toward the door. VERA steps aside.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Just\u2014something.",
        "start_offset": 653.1999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 798
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 371,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nMartin.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Martin.",
        "start_offset": 653.5999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 801
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 372,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 653.9999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 803
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 373,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nAre you checking on her?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Are you checking on her?",
        "start_offset": 654.3999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 805
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 374,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nI'm checking something.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "I'm checking something.",
        "start_offset": 656.3999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 807
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 375,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThat's not an answer.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "That's not an answer.",
        "start_offset": 657.5999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 809
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 376,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nIt's the answer you're getting.\n*He exits through the door to the house. VERA stands alone in the conservatory. She looks at the dead plant. At the water pooled in its saucer. At the garden beyond the glass. She sits in the wicker chair. The magazine is still open to the wrong page. The fan continues its slow rotation. She looks toward the door where MARTIN exited. Toward the ceiling. Toward the garden again.*\n*She opens her mouth to speak. To whom? To the room? To herself? To the Claire who is somewhere above, facing a wall?*\n*No sound comes out.*\n*She closes her mouth.*\n*The light shifts again. Or perhaps it was always this way, and we're only now noticing.*\n*Outside, a rose petal falls.*\n*The fan rotates.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "It's the answer you're getting.",
        "start_offset": 659.1999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 811
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 377,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "FADE TO:\n---",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "FADE TO",
        "text": "---",
        "start_offset": 661.1999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "FADE TO",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 820
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 378,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "INT. CONSERVATORY - EVENING\n*The light has changed. Not darker, but thicker. The quality of late September, perhaps, or the memory of it. The overgrown garden beyond the glass walls is losing its edges to dusk.*\n*CLAIRE (48) sits in the wicker chair, very still. A wine glass in her hand, half-empty. She hasn't turned on any lights. The ceiling fan turns.*\n*The wooden door opens. HUGH (52) enters. He doesn't reach for the light switch. Doesn't greet her. Doesn't apologize for entering. He moves to the other chair, sits.*\n*Silence.*\n*The fan turns.*\n*Claire takes a sip. Doesn't look at him.*\n*Long pause.*",
    "dialogue": []
  },
  {
    "id": 379,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nYou're like me.\n*Claire's hand tightens on the glass. Very slightly.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "You're like me.",
        "start_offset": 661.5999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 830
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 380,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nI'm nothing like you.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "I'm nothing like you.",
        "start_offset": 662.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 833
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 381,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nExactly like me.\n*Pause.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "Exactly like me.",
        "start_offset": 664.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 835
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 382,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nIs that why you came in here? To tell me that?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Is that why you came in here? To tell me that?",
        "start_offset": 665.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 838
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 383,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nI came in here because the room got quiet after you left.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "I came in here because the room got quiet after you left.",
        "start_offset": 669.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 840
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 384,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nQuiet's not so terrible.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Quiet's not so terrible.",
        "start_offset": 674.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 842
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 385,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nVera thinks it is.\n*Claire sets down her glass. The water rings on the table accept it like an old habit.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "Vera thinks it is.",
        "start_offset": 676.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 844
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 386,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nVera thinks a lot of things.\n*Pause.*\nYou don't know me.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Vera thinks a lot of things.",
        "start_offset": 677.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 847
      },
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "You don't know me.",
        "start_offset": 680.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 849
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 387,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nI know you take up very little space. I know you apologize for existing. I know when Vera introduced us you looked at me like I was going to find you out.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "I know you take up very little space. I know you apologize for existing. I know when Vera introduced us you looked at me like I was going to find you out.",
        "start_offset": 681.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 851
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 388,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nFind what out?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Find what out?",
        "start_offset": 694.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 853
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 389,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nWhatever you think needs finding.\n*Silence.*\n*The garden darkens. Or seems to. The light plays tricks here.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "Whatever you think needs finding.",
        "start_offset": 695.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 855
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 390,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nI work in data entry. Have for nine years. Same desk. Same\u2014\n*Pause.*\nThis is boring. You don't need to hear this.\n*But continues anyway, compulsively.*\nSame lunch at twelve-fifteen because everyone else goes at twelve-thirty. I dated someone for three years who I'm not sure\u2014\n*Stops.*\nActually, that's not fair to him. I probably did love him. I'm probably just saying I didn't because that sounds more\u2014\n*Pause.*\nI ended it because I thought he deserved better. Which is what you say when you mean you're the problem but don't want to explain why.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "I work in data entry. Have for nine years. Same desk. Same\u2014",
        "start_offset": 697.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 859
      },
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "This is boring. You don't need to hear this.",
        "start_offset": 702.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 861
      },
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Same lunch at twelve-fifteen because everyone else goes at twelve-thirty. I dated someone for three years who I'm not sure\u2014",
        "start_offset": 706.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 863
      },
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Actually, that's not fair to him. I probably did love him. I'm probably just saying I didn't because that sounds more\u2014",
        "start_offset": 714.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 865
      },
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "I ended it because I thought he deserved better. Which is what you say when you mean you're the problem but don't want to explain why.",
        "start_offset": 722.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 867
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 391,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nYou're performing right now.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "You're performing right now.",
        "start_offset": 733.1999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 869
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 392,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 734.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 871
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 393,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nThis little speech. 'Same desk, same screen.' You've practiced it. Probably in this chair. Probably with that exact glass of wine.\n*Pause.*\nThe boyfriend didn't leave because he realized nothing was there. He left because you kept telling him nothing was there. You made him believe it.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "This little speech. 'Same desk, same screen.' You've practiced it. Probably in this chair. Probably with that exact glass of wine.",
        "start_offset": 735.1999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 873
      },
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "The boyfriend didn't leave because he realized nothing was there. He left because you kept telling him nothing was there. You made him believe it.",
        "start_offset": 743.5999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 875
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 394,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nYou don't\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "You don't\u2014",
        "start_offset": 753.5999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 877
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 395,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nI do. Because I've done it. But I don't dress it up as mercy.\n*Claire looks at him for the first time. Really looks.*\n*Silence.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "I do. Because I've done it. But I don't dress it up as mercy.",
        "start_offset": 754.3999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 879
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 396,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nYou think you're saving her.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "You think you're saving her.",
        "start_offset": 759.9999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 883
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 397,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nI think we're talking about you.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "I think we're talking about you.",
        "start_offset": 761.9999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 885
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 398,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nYou think you're saving her. Vera. With your questions.\n*Hugh pours more wine. First into Claire's glass, then his own. From a bottle we haven't seen until now.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "You think you're saving her. Vera. With your questions.",
        "start_offset": 764.3999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 887
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 399,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nI think I'm watching someone who needs to be watched.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "I think I'm watching someone who needs to be watched.",
        "start_offset": 767.9999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 890
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 400,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nYou think you're the only one who sees her.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "You think you're the only one who sees her.",
        "start_offset": 771.9999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 892
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 401,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nNo.\n*Pause.*\nI think you're the other one. And I think that terrifies you.\n*Claire stands. Moves to the glass wall. Looks at the garden, or at her reflection, or at nothing.*\n*Long pause.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 775.5999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 894
      },
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "I think you're the other one. And I think that terrifies you.",
        "start_offset": 775.9999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 896
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 402,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nYou think you're saving her. With your presence.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "You think you're saving her. With your presence.",
        "start_offset": 780.7999999999982,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 900
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 403,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nNo.\n*Pause.*\nI think I'm the guest who overstays. Who knows he overstays. Who stays anyway because the invitation keeps coming and at some point you stop asking why.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 783.9999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 902
      },
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "I think I'm the guest who overstays. Who knows he overstays. Who stays anyway because the invitation keeps coming and at some point you stop asking why.",
        "start_offset": 784.3999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 904
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 404,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nI think I'm drowning and she's the person standing closest to the water.\n*Hugh doesn't respond. Doesn't move. The statement sits between them like a third person.*\n*Silence.*\n*Claire turns from the glass.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "I think I'm drowning and she's the person standing closest to the water.",
        "start_offset": 795.1999999999982,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 906
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 405,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nI ruin things.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "I ruin things.",
        "start_offset": 800.3999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 911
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 406,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nI know.\n*Pause.*\nSo do I.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "I know.",
        "start_offset": 801.5999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 913
      },
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "So do I.",
        "start_offset": 802.3999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 915
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 407,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nThen why are you here?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Then why are you here?",
        "start_offset": 803.5999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 917
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 408,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nI was invited.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "I was invited.",
        "start_offset": 805.5999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 919
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 409,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nThat's not an answer.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "That's not an answer.",
        "start_offset": 806.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 921
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 410,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nYes it is.\n*Claire moves back to her chair. Sits. Picks up the wine glass.*\n*Pause.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "Yes it is.",
        "start_offset": 808.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 923
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 411,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nYou came in here because the room got quiet. Because Vera notices quiet. Because when Vera notices things she asks about them and you'd rather\u2014what? Control the conversation?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "You came in here because the room got quiet. Because Vera notices quiet. Because when Vera notices things she asks about them and you'd rather\u2014what? Control the conversation?",
        "start_offset": 809.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 927
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 412,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nI came in here because you left.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "I came in here because you left.",
        "start_offset": 820.7999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 929
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 413,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nI left because you were there.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "I left because you were there.",
        "start_offset": 823.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 931
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 414,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nI know.\n*Silence.*\n*The ceiling fan turns. The room is almost dark now. Neither of them moves to turn on a light.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "I know.",
        "start_offset": 825.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 933
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 415,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nWhen did you realize you were like this?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "When did you realize you were like this?",
        "start_offset": 826.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 937
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 416,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nLike what?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "Like what?",
        "start_offset": 829.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 939
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 417,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nExact. Mean. True.\n*Hugh considers this.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Exact. Mean. True.",
        "start_offset": 830.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 941
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 418,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nI don't think I'm mean.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "I don't think I'm mean.",
        "start_offset": 831.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 944
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 419,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nNo?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "No?",
        "start_offset": 833.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 946
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 420,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nI think I'm accurate.\n*Pause.*\nMean would be lying to you. Telling you you're fine. That the person you dated definitely loved you and you probably loved him and everything's just\u2014what? Nerves? Telling you Vera needs your presence the way you need hers. That it's balanced. That it's healthy.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "I think I'm accurate.",
        "start_offset": 834.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 948
      },
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "Mean would be lying to you. Telling you you're fine. That the person you dated definitely loved you and you probably loved him and everything's just\u2014what? Nerves? Telling you Vera needs your presence the way you need hers. That it's balanced. That it's healthy.",
        "start_offset": 835.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 950
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 421,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nYou don't know that it isn't.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "You don't know that it isn't.",
        "start_offset": 853.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 952
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 422,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nYou just told me you're drowning.\n*Claire drinks. Sets down the glass.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "You just told me you're drowning.",
        "start_offset": 855.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 954
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 423,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nFigures of speech.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Figures of speech.",
        "start_offset": 858.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 957
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 424,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nAre very rarely figures.\n*Long pause.*\n*The door to the unseen house remains closed. Vera hasn't come looking. Or hasn't yet. Or won't.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "Are very rarely figures.",
        "start_offset": 859.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 959
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 425,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nWhat do you want from her?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "What do you want from her?",
        "start_offset": 861.1999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 963
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 426,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nFrom Vera?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "From Vera?",
        "start_offset": 863.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 965
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 427,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nWhat do you want?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "What do you want?",
        "start_offset": 864.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 967
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 428,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nTo be here. To be invited. To be the person who gets asked back.\n*Pause.*\nWhat do you want?\n*Claire looks at him. The light\u2014what's left of it\u2014makes her face difficult to read.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "To be here. To be invited. To be the person who gets asked back.",
        "start_offset": 865.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 969
      },
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "What do you want?",
        "start_offset": 871.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 971
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 429,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nTo be needed.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "To be needed.",
        "start_offset": 873.1999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 974
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 430,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nNot the same as being wanted.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "Not the same as being wanted.",
        "start_offset": 874.3999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 976
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 431,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nNo.\n*Pause.*\nIt's more reliable.\n*Hugh almost smiles. Doesn't.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 876.7999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 978
      },
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "It's more reliable.",
        "start_offset": 877.1999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 980
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 432,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nSee? Like me.\n*Claire doesn't answer. The fan turns. The garden is gone now, swallowed by evening. The glass walls reflect only the two of them, sitting in near-darkness, not looking at each other.*\n*Silence.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "See? Like me.",
        "start_offset": 878.3999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 983
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 433,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nShe'll come looking.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "She'll come looking.",
        "start_offset": 879.5999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 987
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 434,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nEventually.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "Eventually.",
        "start_offset": 880.7999999999986,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 989
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 435,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nShe'll ask what we talked about.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "She'll ask what we talked about.",
        "start_offset": 881.1999999999986,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 991
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 436,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nYes.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 883.5999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 993
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 437,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nWhat will you tell her?\n*Hugh stands. Moves toward the door. Stops.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "What will you tell her?",
        "start_offset": 883.9999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 995
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 438,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nThat we sat quietly.\n*Pause.*\nThat it was nice.\n*He opens the door. Light spills in from the unseen house\u2014warm, yellow, ordinary. He doesn't exit immediately.*\nYou think you're protecting her. From me.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "That we sat quietly.",
        "start_offset": 885.9999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 998
      },
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "That it was nice.",
        "start_offset": 887.5999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1000
      },
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "You think you're protecting her. From me.",
        "start_offset": 889.1999999999986,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1002
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 439,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nAren't I?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Aren't I?",
        "start_offset": 891.9999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1004
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 440,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nYou're protecting her from you.\n*Pause.*\nI'm just easier to watch.\n*He exits. The door closes. The warm light disappears.*\n*Claire sits alone in the conservatory. The wine glass in her hand. The ceiling fan turning. She doesn't move to turn on a light.*\n*Long pause.*\n*She lifts the glass. Drinks. Sets it down on the water-ringed table, where it belongs.*\n*The fan turns.*\n*Silence.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "You're protecting her from you.",
        "start_offset": 892.7999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1006
      },
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "I'm just easier to watch.",
        "start_offset": 894.7999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1008
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 441,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "FADE TO:\n---",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "FADE TO",
        "text": "---",
        "start_offset": 896.7999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "FADE TO",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1016
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 442,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "INT. CONSERVATORY - AFTERNOON\n*Afternoon light, but which afternoon? Late summer bleeding into autumn, or the memory of either. The conservatory attached to the unseen house. Glass walls on three sides reveal the overgrown garden\u2014roses gone to seed, stone bench half-swallowed by ivy.*\n*Inside: wicker furniture with faded cushions. A low table bearing water rings like archaeological evidence. The wooden door stage left leads to rooms we'll never enter.*\n*The ceiling fan turns. Slowly. We hear nothing.*\n*MARTIN sits in the best chair, reading. A hardcover book, spine cracked from proper use. He is fifty-something, impeccably dressed for nowhere. His posture suggests a man who has won an argument with gravity.*\n*VERA occupies the loveseat, mending something\u2014a pillowcase, perhaps. Her hands move with the automaticity of decades. She is Martin's age, or older, or younger. Time has made her uncertain.*\n*CLAIRE stands at the glass wall, looking out. Thirty-something. Takes up remarkably little space for a person. She wears yesterday's clothes, or tomorrow's. One hand touches the glass, leaving no print.*\n*No one speaks.*\n*The fan turns.*\n*Martin turns a page. The sound is very loud.*\n*Vera's needle moves through fabric. Pull. Through. Pull. Through.*\n*Claire's hand drops from the glass.*",
    "dialogue": []
  },
  {
    "id": 443,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nI'll leave tomorrow.\n*Vera's hands stop. The needle suspended mid-air. She doesn't look at Claire.*\n*Martin doesn't look up from his book.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "I'll leave tomorrow.",
        "start_offset": 897.1999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1030
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 444,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThere's no need to rush.\n*He turns another page.*\n*Pause.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "There's no need to rush.",
        "start_offset": 898.3999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1034
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 445,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nI make you uncomfortable.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "I make you uncomfortable.",
        "start_offset": 900.3999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1038
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 446,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nNot at all.\n*He continues reading. Or appearing to.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Not at all.",
        "start_offset": 901.9999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1040
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 447,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nI make everyone uncomfortable.\n*Pause.*\nIt's the only thing I'm good at.\n*Vera sets down her mending carefully. As if it might break.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "I make everyone uncomfortable.",
        "start_offset": 903.1999999999986,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1043
      },
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "It's the only thing I'm good at.",
        "start_offset": 904.7999999999986,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1045
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 448,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nClaire\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Claire\u2014",
        "start_offset": 907.5999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1048
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 449,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nDon't.\n*She turns from the window. Looks at Vera now.*\nDon't be kind. I can't\u2014\n*She stops.*\n*Martin closes the book. Deliberately. The sound is very careful. He looks at Claire now. His eyes find her with the precision of a weapon.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Don't.",
        "start_offset": 907.9999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1050
      },
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Don't be kind. I can't\u2014",
        "start_offset": 908.3999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1052
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 450,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYou've constructed a rather elegant little tragedy, haven't you? Complete with metaphor.\n*Pause.*\n\"Uncomfortable.\" As if your presence were a force of nature. As if choice had nothing to do with it.\n*He sets the book on the table. On top of the water rings.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "You've constructed a rather elegant little tragedy, haven't you? Complete with metaphor.",
        "start_offset": 910.3999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1056
      },
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "\"Uncomfortable.\" As if your presence were a force of nature. As if choice had nothing to do with it.",
        "start_offset": 915.1999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1058
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 451,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nI wanted to see if anyone else had survived.\n*Silence.*\n*The fan turns. One rotation. Two.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "I wanted to see if anyone else had survived.",
        "start_offset": 922.7999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1061
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 452,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nSurvived what?\n*Claire doesn't look at him. Looks at Vera.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Survived what?",
        "start_offset": 926.3999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1065
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 453,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nThis.\n*Pause.*\nWhatever this is.\n*Pause.*\nBeing somebody's daughter. Somebody's sister.\n*Long pause.*\nSomebody's wife.\n*Martin stands.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "This.",
        "start_offset": 927.1999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1068
      },
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Whatever this is.",
        "start_offset": 927.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1070
      },
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Being somebody's daughter. Somebody's sister.",
        "start_offset": 928.7999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1072
      },
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Somebody's wife.",
        "start_offset": 930.7999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1074
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 454,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nYou've made survival into theater. Relationships into natural disasters.\n*Pause.*\nThat's absurd.\n*Claire finally looks at him.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "You've made survival into theater. Relationships into natural disasters.",
        "start_offset": 931.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1077
      },
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "That's absurd.",
        "start_offset": 935.1999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1079
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 455,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nYes.\n*Silence.*\n*Vera stands. Walks to the glass wall. Her back to both of them. She touches the pane where Claire touched it moments before.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 935.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1082
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 456,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nMaybe it isn't.\n*Martin stares at his wife's back.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Maybe it isn't.",
        "start_offset": 936.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1086
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 457,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nVera\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Vera\u2014",
        "start_offset": 937.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1089
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 458,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI've always known it wasn't.\n*Still to the glass.*\n*Pause.*\nI just needed someone else to say it first.\n*Claire watches Vera's back. Her hand rises, falls. Rises again.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I've always known it wasn't.",
        "start_offset": 937.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1091
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I just needed someone else to say it first.",
        "start_offset": 939.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1094
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 459,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nDo you ever feel\u2014\n*She stops.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Do you ever feel\u2014",
        "start_offset": 943.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1097
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 460,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhat?\n*Still to the glass.*\n*Claire steps back from the moment.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 945.1999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1100
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 461,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nNothing. Forget it.\n*Pause.*\nI shouldn't have come. This was\u2014\n*She looks at the door.*\nI'll pack now, actually. Not tomorrow.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Nothing. Forget it.",
        "start_offset": 945.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1104
      },
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "I shouldn't have come. This was\u2014",
        "start_offset": 946.7999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1106
      },
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "I'll pack now, actually. Not tomorrow.",
        "start_offset": 949.1999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1108
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 462,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nClaire\u2014\n*Turning.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Claire\u2014",
        "start_offset": 951.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1110
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 463,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nNo.\n*She moves toward the door. Not the house door. The garden door.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 951.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1113
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 464,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThis is ridiculous.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "This is ridiculous.",
        "start_offset": 952.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1116
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 465,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nIs it?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Is it?",
        "start_offset": 953.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1118
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 466,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nPeople have obligations. Responsibilities. That's not surviving, that's\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "People have obligations. Responsibilities. That's not surviving, that's\u2014",
        "start_offset": 954.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1120
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 467,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhat?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "What?",
        "start_offset": 957.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1122
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 468,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nLiving. That's living.\n*Vera looks at him for the first time.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Living. That's living.",
        "start_offset": 957.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1124
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 469,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nIs it?\n*Silence.*\n*Martin's hand gestures at the room. The gesture includes everything. The garden. The fan. His wife. Claire. Himself.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Is it?",
        "start_offset": 959.1999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1127
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 470,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThis is perfectly\u2014\n*He stops.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "This is perfectly\u2014",
        "start_offset": 959.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1131
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 471,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nSay it.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Say it.",
        "start_offset": 961.1999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1134
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 472,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nNormal.\n*The word sits in the air like something dead.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Normal.",
        "start_offset": 961.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1136
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 473,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nYes.\n*Very quietly.*\n*She opens the door. The garden smell enters\u2014green rot, late roses, earth.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 962.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1139
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 474,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nWhere are you going?\n*Claire doesn't answer. Steps through. Into the overgrown garden. The door stays open behind her.*\n*Martin and Vera stand very still.*\n*Through the glass, we see Claire walking into the roses. Her figure becoming less distinct. Or the light is changing. Or we're losing the ability to see clearly.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Where are you going?",
        "start_offset": 962.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1143
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 475,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nShe'll come back.\n*Vera doesn't respond.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "She'll come back.",
        "start_offset": 964.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1148
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 476,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nShe always comes back.\n*Vera walks to the open door. Stands in the threshold. One foot in the conservatory. One foot in the garden.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "She always comes back.",
        "start_offset": 965.5999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1151
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 477,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nDoes she?\n*Martin looks at his wife. At her back. At the garden beyond. At Claire's disappearing figure.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Does she?",
        "start_offset": 967.1999999999985,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1154
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 478,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nVera\u2014\n*But Vera is already stepping through. Into the green. Into the rot. Into the late roses.*\n*Martin stands alone in the conservatory.*\n*The fan turns.*\n*He walks to the open door.*\n*Stands where Vera stood.*\n*The garden waits.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Vera\u2014",
        "start_offset": 967.9999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1157
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 479,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nThis is\u2014\n*He stops.*\n*Long pause.*\nThis is perfectly\u2014\n*He stops again.*\n*Through the glass walls, we see Vera has stopped walking. She stands among the roses. Waiting. Or not waiting. Simply standing.*\n*Claire is farther out. Nearly invisible now in the overgrown green.*\n*Martin's hand touches the doorframe.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "This is\u2014",
        "start_offset": 968.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1165
      },
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "This is perfectly\u2014",
        "start_offset": 969.1999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1168
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 480,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nNormal.\n*Very quietly.*\n*But he doesn't move.*\n*The fan turns.*\n*The light continues changing.*\n*And Martin stands in the threshold\u2014*\n*One foot in.*\n*One foot out.*\n*Unable to choose.*\n*Unable to look away.*\n*Silence.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Normal.",
        "start_offset": 970.3999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1174
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 481,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "FADE TO:\n---",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "FADE TO",
        "text": "---",
        "start_offset": 970.7999999999984,
        "visual_focus": "FADE TO",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1186
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 482,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "INT. CONSERVATORY - AFTERNOON\n*The next afternoon. The same afternoon. All afternoons.*\n*The conservatory breathes its thick air. Beyond the glass: roses unpruned, patience rewarded with chaos.*\n*CLAIRE's overnight bag sits by the door to the house. She sits furthest from it.*\n*HUGH moves among them with a tea service\u2014proper china, the ceremony of it. He pours. Offers biscuits on a plate. No one takes them.*\n*MARTIN occupies his chair like a throne. VERA perches on the edge of hers.*\n*The fan turns.*",
    "dialogue": []
  },
  {
    "id": 483,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nMilk?\n*Placing cup before Claire.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "Milk?",
        "start_offset": 971.1999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1195
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 484,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nNo.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 971.5999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1198
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 485,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nSugar?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "Sugar?",
        "start_offset": 971.9999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1200
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 486,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nNo.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 972.3999999999983,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1202
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 487,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nVera?\n*Pouring for Vera.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "Vera?",
        "start_offset": 972.7999999999982,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1204
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 488,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nOh\u2014yes. Both. Please. If it's not\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Oh\u2014yes. Both. Please. If it's not\u2014",
        "start_offset": 973.1999999999982,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1207
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 489,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nIt isn't.\n*Pause.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "It isn't.",
        "start_offset": 975.5999999999982,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1209
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 490,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nThank you.\n*Hugh pours for Martin without asking. Black. He knows. He pours for himself.*\n*They hold their cups. No one drinks.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "start_offset": 976.3999999999982,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1212
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 491,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nI've arranged a car for four o'clock.\n*To Claire.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "I've arranged a car for four o'clock.",
        "start_offset": 977.1999999999981,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1216
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 492,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nThank you.\n*She doesn't move toward her bag.*\n*Silence.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "start_offset": 979.9999999999981,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1219
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 493,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nYour garden must be\u2014I mean, with all the rain we've had\u2014\n*To Hugh.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Your garden must be\u2014I mean, with all the rain we've had\u2014",
        "start_offset": 980.799999999998,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1223
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 494,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nThe rain helps.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "The rain helps.",
        "start_offset": 985.199999999998,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1226
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 495,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nDoes it?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Does it?",
        "start_offset": 986.399999999998,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1228
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 496,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nWhen things are newly planted.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "When things are newly planted.",
        "start_offset": 987.199999999998,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1230
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 497,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nOh.\n*Pause.*\nAre you planting? Now?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Oh.",
        "start_offset": 989.199999999998,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1232
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Are you planting? Now?",
        "start_offset": 989.599999999998,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1234
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 498,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nRoses.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "Roses.",
        "start_offset": 991.199999999998,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1236
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 499,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nHow lovely.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "How lovely.",
        "start_offset": 991.599999999998,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1238
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 500,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nThe same variety as those.\n*He gestures toward the garden beyond the glass.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "The same variety as those.",
        "start_offset": 992.3999999999979,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1240
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 501,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nReally?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Really?",
        "start_offset": 994.3999999999979,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1243
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 502,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nBut cared for.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "But cared for.",
        "start_offset": 994.7999999999979,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1245
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 503,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nRoses do perfectly well wild.\n*Hugh sets down his cup.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Roses do perfectly well wild.",
        "start_offset": 995.999999999998,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1247
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 504,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nDo they?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "Do they?",
        "start_offset": 997.999999999998,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1250
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 505,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nNature doesn't require our intervention.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Nature doesn't require our intervention.",
        "start_offset": 998.7999999999979,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1252
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 506,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nNature doesn't require anything.\n*Long pause.*\nBut we're not discussing nature.\n*Silence. The fan turns.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "Nature doesn't require anything.",
        "start_offset": 1000.7999999999979,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1254
      },
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "But we're not discussing nature.",
        "start_offset": 1002.3999999999979,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1256
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 507,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nWill you come with me?\n*To Vera, sudden.*\n*Everyone stops. Even the light seems to hold.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Will you come with me?",
        "start_offset": 1004.3999999999979,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1259
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 508,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nWhere?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Where?",
        "start_offset": 1006.3999999999979,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1263
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 509,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nDoes it matter?\n*Vera's cup trembles. Tea surfaces shiver.*\n*Long pause.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "Does it matter?",
        "start_offset": 1006.7999999999979,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1265
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 510,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nI don't\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I don't\u2014",
        "start_offset": 1007.999999999998,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1269
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 511,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nDon't be ridiculous.\n*Not to Claire.*\n*A small sound escapes Vera\u2014not quite a laugh. Helpless.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Don't be ridiculous.",
        "start_offset": 1008.7999999999979,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1271
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 512,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nNo.\n*Pause.*\nI won't come.\n*Claire nods. She knew. Knows. Will always know.*\n*She rises. Takes her bag. The weight of it\u2014everything she owns or nothing that matters.*\n*She moves to the door. Stops. Turns back.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 1009.999999999998,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1275
      },
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "I won't come.",
        "start_offset": 1010.3999999999979,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1277
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 513,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nThe conservatory is beautiful, Martin.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "The conservatory is beautiful, Martin.",
        "start_offset": 1011.599999999998,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1282
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 514,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\n\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "\u2014",
        "start_offset": 1013.599999999998,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1284
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 515,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "CLAIRE\nAll this glass.\n*Pause.*\nBut what are you conserving?\n*She wavers\u2014almost stays, almost apologizes.*\nI didn't mean\u2014\n*But she's already moving. The door. The exit. Not letting herself take it back or make it right.*\n*Pause.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "All this glass.",
        "start_offset": 1013.999999999998,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1286
      },
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "But what are you conserving?",
        "start_offset": 1015.199999999998,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1288
      },
      {
        "character": "CLAIRE",
        "text": "I didn't mean\u2014",
        "start_offset": 1017.199999999998,
        "visual_focus": "CLAIRE",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1290
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 516,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "MARTIN\nEverything that matters.\n*Carefully.*\n*But Claire is already through the door. It closes behind her.*\n*In the distance: the sound of the front door. Opening. Closing.*\n*The three remain.*\n*Silence.*\n*Martin's words hang in the empty air. No one to receive them.*\n*Hugh rises.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "MARTIN",
        "text": "Everything that matters.",
        "start_offset": 1018.399999999998,
        "visual_focus": "MARTIN",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1294
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 517,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nI should go.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "I should go.",
        "start_offset": 1019.5999999999981,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1303
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 518,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "VERA\nStay.\n*She doesn't look at him when she says it.*\n*Martin says nothing.*\n*Hugh remains standing. Then sits.*\n*Long pause.*\n*Vera reaches for the biscuit plate. Takes one. Sets it on her saucer. Breaks it carefully. Into smaller pieces. Smaller still. She doesn't eat. Just breaks. Looking at the door Claire exited through.*\n*Martin looks at his hands\u2014their architecture, their emptiness.*\n*Hugh looks at Vera.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "VERA",
        "text": "Stay.",
        "start_offset": 1020.7999999999981,
        "visual_focus": "VERA",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1305
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 519,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "HUGH\nYou said no very quickly.\n*To Vera.*\n*Vera's hands stop. A piece of biscuit between her fingers.*\n*Pause.*\nDid you mean it?\n*Vera looks at Hugh. At Martin. At the crumbs on her saucer.*\n*Long silence.*\n*The fan turns.*\n*Outside, the garden continues its patient work of reclamation. The roses grow toward or away from something. Does it matter?*\n*The light doesn't change. This afternoon. Every afternoon.*\n*Martin's cup sits untouched on the table, the surface still as a mirror, reflecting only ceiling, only glass.*\n*Vera's fingers hold the broken biscuit.*\n*Hugh waits.*\n*Silence.*\n*The fan turns.*\n*The light holds.*\n*Fade\u2014not to darkness, but to the turning. The endless, gentle, terrible turning.*",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "You said no very quickly.",
        "start_offset": 1021.1999999999981,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1314
      },
      {
        "character": "HUGH",
        "text": "Did you mean it?",
        "start_offset": 1023.1999999999981,
        "visual_focus": "HUGH",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 1318
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 520,
    "duration_sec": 125.72727272727273,
    "content": "END OF PLAY",
    "dialogue": []
  }
]
